Ignacio E. Grossmann. Enterprise-wide Optimization: A New Frontier in Process Systems Engineering, AIChE Journal 51(7), 1846–1857, 2005, DOI 10.1002/aic.10617. [Author/university full text](https://egon.cheme.cmu.edu/Papers/GrossmannEWO.pdf) · [Publisher](https://aiche.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/pdf/10.1002/aic.10617).

Read the whole paper, reconstruct its modelling hierarchy and follow its primary references into the chosen research problem. Compare plant-level feasibility with purchasing, manufacturing, inventory and distribution decisions taken at different time scales. Develop a small transparent chemical case before pursuing a large optimisation model.

Author, publication identity, full-text route and the 2005 AIChE copyright notice were verified on 29 October 2026. Authorized author-hosted reading is not described as unrestricted redistribution. The article provides a dated research perspective, not proof that every model or integrated system it proposes has been deployed. Full primary methods and subsequent corrections should accompany later scholarship. Nothing is mirrored.

